# base44-projects

> HTML list shelf for Base44 apps. Sister of base44.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/base44-projects.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the project list.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader to base44 for the core, or to a named app.

## Key ideas
- Base44 projects (the list)
- HTML source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/base44-projects
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/base44-projects”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the core → base44

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a project-list door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source, or base44.
